          choix: [R`$\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{10}\frac{k}{2^k}$`, R`$\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{1024}\frac{k}{2^k}$`, R`$\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{10}\frac{k}{2k}$`, R`$\displaystyle\sum_{k=0}^{10}\frac{k+1}{2^k}$`], bonne: 0,
